1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,424
Third, isothermal: constant temperature.

2
00:00:03,424 --> 00:00:08,307
Stand the cylinder in a big water bath and let it expand very slowly.

3
00:00:08,307 --> 00:00:12,786
Heat flows in just fast enough to keep the temperature fixed.

4
00:00:12,786 --> 00:00:18,085
No temperature change means delta U is zero, so Q equals W.

5
00:00:18,085 --> 00:00:22,682
The curve is P V equals constant, a rectangular hyperbola.

